Hummingbot — Apache License, Version 2.0
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

This product includes code derived from Hummingbot
(https://github.com/hummingbot/hummingbot):

1. The depth-walk math from ``hummingbot/core/data_type/order_book.pyx``
   (the ``get_price_for_volume`` and ``get_vwap_for_volume`` reference
