2. The ``strategy_v2/executors`` pattern — abstract ``ExecutorBase``
   status state machine with ``PositionExecutor`` / ``TWAPExecutor``
   specialisations driving child orders through a broker connector.

Affected file(s) in this repository:

* ``src/equity/depth_pricing.py`` (US-014 — depth-aware equity
  execution pricing). Clean-room re-derivation in pure Python; the
  original Hummingbot file is not vendored.
* ``src/equity/executors.py`` (US-015 — order-lifecycle executor
  framework: ``ExecutorBase``, ``PositionExecutor``, ``TWAPExecutor``
  adapted from ``hummingbot/strategy_v2/executors``). Clean-room
  re-derivation in pure Python; the original Hummingbot files are not
  vendored.

