TradingAgents — Apache License, Version 2.0
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

This product includes a clean-room reimplementation of the reflection
loop pattern from TradingAgents
(https://github.com/TauricResearch/TradingAgents): a planning-layer
agent logs each decision as pending, computes alpha against a
benchmark on outcome maturity, distills a compact alpha-cited lesson,
and injects curated lessons into the next planning prompt.

Affected file(s) in this repository:

* ``src/equity/reflection.py`` (US-019 — outcome-grounded reflection
  loop, Tier-7 planning surface only). ~100 lines of pure Python; no
  source from TradingAgents is copied or vendored. The "lesson" text
  is rendered deterministically from a template — no LLM call is made
  in this module, which keeps ``src/equity/`` LLM-free per the
  ``tests/test_no_llm_in_equity_path.py`` canary.

